window.products.push({"id":1069015,"name":"Brooklyn Brew Shop/Evil Twin Bikini Beer Making Kit: All-Grain Set With Reusable Glass Fermenter, Brew Equipment, Ingredients (Malted Barley, Hops, Ye","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813jT4RmsRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you can make oatmeal, you can make beer. Brooklyn Brew Shop's kitchen-friendly beer making kits makes brewing easy by using only fresh, whole ingredients and traditional methods used in homes and breweries for centuries. By brewing with the same ingredients (malted barley, hops, and yeast) that the best craft breweries in the world use, making high quality and complex beers becomes possible on the stovetop in your very own kitchen, big or small. The beach meets the bottle in our quintessential summer Bikini Beer. Modeled as a collaboration with Brooklyn-based and Denmark-rooted brewery, Evil Twin, this beautifully-bright and crisp beer brings a splash of the ocean to your stovetop. Suiting up at only 2.8%, Bikini Beer's extremely light body barely covers up a heavily-hopped ale featuring a bouquet from Falconer's Flight, Simcoe and Cascade hops. Easy enough to drink in the warm sand, yet hoppy enough to sustain a sand castle, Bikini Beer refreshes and satisfies wave after wave. Drinkable in the sun, the sand and the water, Bikini Beer ensures an endless summer of balmy brewing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813jT4RmsRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brooklyn Brew Shop","source_asin":"B00R4J474A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1069015","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00R4J474A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00R4J474A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
