window.products.push({"id":1069115,"name":"BOSKA Slate Serving Platter - Large Best For Cheese, Tapas, Bread, and Desserts Presentation - Board Slab with Non-Slip Feet - Cutting and Charcuterie","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61avhWsVJcL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Cheese Board \"L\" Slate Good cheese deserves a great looking cheese board. So take this one, in slate! The dark aesthetic of the board contrasts beautifully with the light, bright cheeses, instantly classing up your cheese presentation. The natural edges give a rustic yet sophisticated flair that will have your guests coming back for more. - GREAT DESIGN: High quality, 8mm thick slate with anti-slip feet - LEVEL UP YOUR PRESENTATION: Write the name of the cheese on the slate board with chalk or soapstone (not included) - HYGIENIC: Slate does not absorb smells or bacteria - EASY TO CLEAN: Dishwasher safe The fine art of cheese boarding A cheese board is delicious as a dessert or as a snack -there's no right or wrong way to build one. Cover your bases and get one bloomy rind, one washed rind, one blue rind, one fresh, and one hard cheese. Or play on a theme - cheeses from a particular region or that are currently in season. Enrich your board with crackers, nuts, fruit, and dips. They're appealing to the eye, but also to the taste buds. Size This board is 13 inches x 9 inches -easily large enough for 3 cheeses. Maintenance Slate is a naturally porous substance that can appear stained after use. Simply give the whole board a rub of mineral oil, and then wash it in the dishwasher or by hand. About Boska Holland Cheesewares; We love cheese! Since 1896, here at Boska, it's been our mission to spread the love of cheese to everyone everywhere. Our innovative family-owned company started as a blacksmith making tools for the cheese farmers in Holland, and now we are the world's only specialist in Cheesewares;: cheese tools and accessories. In short: we sell everything you need to enjoy cheese except the cheese itself!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61avhWsVJcL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BOSKA","source_asin":"B082PL5TYR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1069115","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082PL5TYR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082PL5TYR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1069116,"name":"Intex Comfort Bed - Rising Comfort Queen Airbed with Remote Control","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71civx92R1S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Designed for fitted sheets, this unique bed features two virtually independent chambers connected by four flow-through ports which provides extra firmness and support. The internal construction of both chambers ensures stability and sleeping comfort. Mattress is raised 19\" from the floor for convenience. Quality tested 20.8 gauge waterproof flocked top with 14 gauge vinyl beams and 16 gauge sides and bottom. Comes with built-in 110-120 Volt A/c Electric Pump which allows for inflating in about 3 minutes! Quickly and easily inflate both chambers with a remote control. Then adjust to any level of firmness for the ultimate in comfort. If electrical power is not available then a separately operated pump can be connected to the control valve for inflation: simply turn the control dial to the inflation symbol, insert the air pump nozzle into the valve at the center of the control dial, and inflate the airbed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71civx92R1S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Intex","source_asin":"B000CSX22S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1069116","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000CSX22S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000CSX22S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
