window.products.push({"id":1069226,"name":"Good Dee's Yellow 3 Piece Whisk Set, stainless steel, with silicon scraper attached, egg yolk separator included, large and small whisks","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31f6WDdsRbL._AC_.jpg","description":"Good Dee's is back with a Good Dee's YELLOW whisk set! What better way to mix your Good Dee's mixes or frosting? UNIQUE DESIGN: This is a 2 in 2 egg whisk-one larger size one smaller in stainless steel. In addition, it has an elastic silicone bowl scraper. No need to use a separate scraper to get every last bit of that mix-this whisk has it for you! Pour your batter after mixing it and use the scrapers for the sides of bowl to get every last delicious bit! TWO SIZES: These awesome stainless steel whisk set comes with TWO whisks! One smaller size at 10 inches (for smaller baking or mixing) and 13 inches (for our Good Dee's 1 pound bag batches!) WHICH ONE DO YOU USE? We recommend you use the 13 inch one for big bowls of Good Dee's cake or Good Dee's frosting mixing (such as our double batch bags!). The 10 inch whisk is great for the wet ingredients you need for our mixes: beating eggs, butter, and coconut oil. BONUS PRODUCT: What best to add to a whisk set? An egg separator! This can be great to separate the yolk from the egg whites if you want to elevate any of our mixes. Fluff up some egg whites before adding in the yolks and fold in a Good Dee's Cake Mix to see what fluffy wonders will happen!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31f6WDdsRbL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Good Dee's","source_asin":"B09WTHKGLT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1069226","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WTHKGLT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WTHKGLT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
