window.products.push({"id":1069282,"name":"Super Thick Nonstick Cookie Sheet Pan, Rectangular Carbon Steel Baking Pan for Oven Roasting Meat Bread Jelly Roll Brownie Pizzas Pastries, Oven & Dis","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ySm2x3MOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Two Flowers focus on developing and manufacturing nonstick baking pans since 2018. It is our eternal goal to achieve the professional baker effect even at home. SPECIFICATION: Dimension: 11 x 9 x1.1 inch Material: Carbon steel Color: Gold Weight: 420g Package included: 1 Heavy Baking Pan NOTICE: 1. Cool it for at least 10 minutes before cleaning after take the baking pan out from the oven 2. Dishwasher safe, or hand wash in warm, soapy water, and avoid abrasive cleaning pads or cleaner","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ySm2x3MOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Two Flowers","source_asin":"B08XBNHPHB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1069282","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XBNHPHB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XBNHPHB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1069283,"name":"RocFath Automatic Soap Dispenser Touchless, Foaming Hand Soap Dispenser with Waterproof Design, 3 Adjustable Levels, 9.5 oz Rechargeable Foam Soap Dis","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wm9mHO9tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[ Automatic Soap Dispenser Touchless ] Built-in infrared sensor, this hand soap dispenser can sense and dispense soap accurately when you place your hands under the sensor within the range of 0-2in. Hands-free and touchless features effectively avoid cross infection, make your washing more hygienic and safer [ 3-Level Adjustable Soap Output Volume ] Features with 3 different liquid soap dispenser settings, this dish soap dispenser allows you to set your desired volume easily by pressing the power button. Easy to use and quick to dispense. Always get the right amount of soap that you want [ Stable, Waterproof & Non-slip Design ] Giraffe shape design lowers the gravity center, reduces the chance of being knocked down accidentally. Magnetic and water-resistant charge connector puts away your worries about residual water in the charging port, and it is universal and very convenient and easy to plug in. But no adapter. Non-slip mat at the bottom of this automatic foaming soap dispenser [ Rechargeable Design ] This foam soap dispenser equipped with a 1200mAh battery which usually supports up to at least 90 days of battery life. Compare with battery operated dispensers, it reduces the environmental impact of discarded batteries and saves lots of money [ Eyes Light Timer ] The blinking eyes light on top of this auto soap dispenser touchless reminds you wash your hands for at least 15 seconds and encourage children to wash their hands often and effectively. So not only can you put it next to the kitchen sink, but you can also put it on the bathroom countertop","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wm9mHO9tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RocFath","source_asin":"B0BPYRMC15","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1069283","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPYRMC15","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPYRMC15","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1069284,"name":"Cuisinart TCS-60 Convection Steamer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":149.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ZFFYJ2KQL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description 6 qt. oval steam tray. Second steaming tray. Removable water reservoir. 60 minute timer. Automatic shut-off when timer cycle finishes. Audible signal when steaming cycle is complete. 5 cup rice bowl. White. 3 year limited warranty. Boxed. Made in China by Amazon.com With a fan circulating steam, this electric appliance prepares a meal in about two-thirds the time an ordinary steamer would require. The steamer is large enough for a family, with a 6-quart steaming tray, a shallower tray that sits atop the main tray, and a bowl that holds 5 cups of cooked rice. Oval to accommodate a fish or chicken and long vegetables like asparagus, the steamer is simple to operate. Fill the detachable water reservoir (it has a printed guide showing various foods' steaming times), place food in the trays or rice bowl, insert the fan into the lid, and set the timer, which will shut off the steamer when time's up and send out an audible signal. The parts are all durable plastic, and most are dishwasher-safe. The steamer measures 12 inches wide and stands 10 inches high. Cuisinart includes a clear set of operating instructions and numerous recipes. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ZFFYJ2KQL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cuisinart","source_asin":"B00004WKI6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1069284","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004WKI6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004WKI6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1069285,"name":"Heyrsun Electric Salt and Pepper Grinder Set, 2 Usb Rechargeable Stainless Pepper Grinder with Led Light, Adjustable Coarseness, Refillable Automatic ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710DX-9T6kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Made to Last: Many ordinary electric pepper grinders use cheap motors, resulting in a short service life and poor grinding effect. HEYRSUN uses a patented US motor with a speed of 14,000 RPM, providing powerful power for grinding spices. The special anti-corrosion material and separate space design prevent salt and other spices from penetrating and damaging the internal device. Ready to Use: This rechargeable salt and pepper grinder set has a built-in 500mAh rechargeable lithium battery that you don't need to waste extra money on AA batteries. It can be used 200 to 300 times on a single charge, and can enjoy fresh pepper and salt anytime even when outdoors. The package includes charging base and USB cable. White Led Light and Low Noise: The gravity salt and pepper grinder set is EMC certified and works at no more than 50 decibels. Excellent working performance is loved. In addition, the electric salt and pepper grinder is equipped with a white LED light, clear and bright. As long as the grinder is working, the light will automatically turn on. Prevents you from over-seasoning food in a dark. Five-Level Grinding Effect: HEYRSUN electric salt and pepper shakers has twice the speed of a normal grinder. Powerful grinding power and upgraded ceramic core, which provide first-class grinding speed and grinding quality. Simply turn the top knob to set the desired coarseness, clockwise for fine grains and counterclockwise for coarse grains. Convenient and quick. Ideal Gift: Who can refuse to sprinkle fresh pepper and salt on their food? You can use the electric salt and pepper grinder set rechargeable for cooking, grilling or outdoor picnics. The exquisite gift box and premium design make it a great gift for Christmas, Thanksgiving, New Year, and housewarming! Come on, surprise your family and friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710DX-9T6kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HEYRSUN","source_asin":"B0BX3RWS38","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1069285","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BX3RWS38","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BX3RWS38","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1069286,"name":"Tervis 1362583 Kelly Ventura - Posy Insulated Tumbler, 24oz Water Bottle, Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61M3gQ8oByL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tervis insulated drinkware delivers the ultimate combination of personality and performance for pure drinking enjoyment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61M3gQ8oByL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tervis","source_asin":"B086KGSVK7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1069286","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086KGSVK7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086KGSVK7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1069287,"name":"MIU France Brushed Stainless Steel Paper Napkin Holder, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/411B0TXPT3L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Stainless Steel Napkin Holder Amazon.com Napkin holders are often poorly designed; many are so flimsy and light that the mere act of grabbing a napkin from it can knock them over. This is definitely not the case with MIU France's stainless steel napkin holder. For one thing, the napkins lie flat, parallel with the table, on a brushed steel tray. Two side pieces keep the napkins centered, and a steel bar weights them down. On either end, this bar slides into grooves in the side struts, lowering as each napkin is dispensed. A small rubberized square under where the napkins sit keeps the stack from sliding around. The look of the MIU France napkin holder is both modern and neutral, formal and casual; it would be suitable on a kitchen breakfast table or on a festive holiday buffet. It is made of sturdy, low-gloss, brushed 18/10 cadmium-free stainless steel. Cleaning is easy; use a warm cloth or sponge and hot soapy water, and avoid harsh abrasive scrubbers or cleansers. If necessary, the separate steel bar could be washed in the dishwasher, but the actual napkin holder should be washed by hand to avoid wetting the rubberized friction square, as that might weaken the underlying adhesive. --Garland Withers","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/411B0TXPT3L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MIU France","source_asin":"B0000DZCJ5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1069287","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000DZCJ5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000DZCJ5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
