window.products.push({"id":1069423,"name":"Kitchen Rug Set Runner Mat Floor Mats Bathroom Rugs Soft Doormat with White Dot for Bedroom Living Room (15.7\" * 47.2\" Red-40120)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rimwiNtpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Daily Cleaning Steps: 1-Reverse the rug and shake off the sands and dust.  2-Vacuum the sands and dust on the surface of rug.  3-Clean the floor on where the rug was put.   4-Put the rug back. Normal Rinsing Steps: 1-Reverse the rug and shake off the sands and dust. 2-Rinse the rug with water under 40 degree Celsius by high pressure pipe. Neutral detergent can be used during rinsing.(avoiding using acidic detergent and alkaline detergent which can reduce the service life of the rug). 3-Air dry the rug. 4-Clean the floor on where the rug was put. 5-Put the rug back. Special Stain Cleaning Methods: 1. Edible Fat & Oil Cleaning Method: Clean fat and oil with gasoline and volatile solvent such as Carbon tetrachloride first, and then clean with ethyl alcohol.  2. Soy sauce cleaning Method: Soy sauce stain can be removed by cleaning with cold water and detergent. Old soy sauce stain can be removed by warm water with detergent andaqueous ammonia together, and then rinse the rug with water. 3. Alcohol Stain Cleaning Method: Fresh alcohol stain can be removed by rinsing with water. Old alcohol stain can be removed with aqueous solution of aqueous ammonia and borax. 4. Coffee & Tea Stain Cleaning Method: Coffee & tea stain can be removed by aqueous ammonia, or rinsing with water after being soaked in Neutral detergent about 10-20 minutes, or cleaning with 10% glycerol detergent. Notes: To increase the serve life, something can be done. 1. Let the rug air-dry, nor exposing in the burning sun after cleaning. 2. Avoid anti-slip base of the rug being exposed in the burning sun.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rimwiNtpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aboo","source_asin":"B07GZHHVPG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1069423","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GZHHVPG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GZHHVPG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
