window.products.push({"id":1069475,"name":"Alen TF30, 2 Count (Pack of 1), Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41FyKrKLmSL._AC_.jpg","description":"Designed for the Alen T100 or T300 Air Purifiers, the Alen HEPA-Silver Filter combines three layers of filter technology to purify and freshen the air in your home while protecting the filter against bacteria and microbes. Polluted air first passes through Alen's washable Pre-Filter to capture large particles, extending the life of the filter. In the second layer, air moves through a unique, electrostatically charged HEPA material that attracts and captures dust, pollen, pet dander, mold spores and other airborne pollutants. Alen's Silver-Ion threads are woven into the HEPA material, protecting the filter from harmful bacteria and microbe growth. The final layer, clean air passes through a layer of Alen's Activated Carbon, reducing light odors and chemicals commonly found in the air from cleaning products, smoke, cooking, pets and various other household materials. Test results demonstrate a 99.99% capture rate on E. Coli and Staph Bacteria. Note: The HEPA-Silver (TF30-Silver) replacement Filter includes two (2) filters. Alen T300 Air Purifier requires both filters. The Alen T100 Air Purifier requires only one. Instructions for Use: Over time, the HEPA-Silver Filter becomes overloaded with particles, decreasing its filtration performance. We recommend regular filter replacements, at least every 6 months with normal use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41FyKrKLmSL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alen","source_asin":"B0BGPCJPVR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1069475","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGPCJPVR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGPCJPVR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
