window.products.push({"id":1069624,"name":"Solid 100% Pure Copper Moscow Mule Mug– Each 16 oz Handcrafted Mug is Unique - No Nickel/Tin/Al Interior – Easy To Hold Handle, Food Safe - Perfect Th","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pL38EfMBL._AC_SL1494_.jpg","description":"Serve up your drink in style with the retro Threshold Moscow Mule Copper Mugs. Originally crafted in 1940s specifically for drinking Moscow Mule cocktails. Our polished copper mugs are handcrafted by artisans in India who carry on the ancient traditions of Anatolian metalworking. With amazing handle gives an excellent look to the mug. No Nickel Lining, No Tin lining, No Aluminum or Steel Lining, ALL COPPER. Their design is a classic for serving iced cocktails such as the Moscow Mule, a blend of vodka, ginger beer and lime juice, but they can be used for any iced beverage. The sturdy, stainless steel mug will help keep cold drinks while the copper finish creates a classic feel. •Solid copper Moscow mule mug experience with perfect size of 16 oz. Enjoy the perfect size and leaked proof party time mug. Handcrafted copper mug stainless steel Classic • Well shaped and good looking handle which is much easy to carry and can be used for beverages. Tarnish resistant, food-safe lacquer coating protects both the inside and outside of mug • Makes a fun and unique gift and is a great addition to any bar • Quick and easy to clean and take care of Handcrafted by some of the best copper artisans in India, our copper mug is adorned with a stylish, angular brass handle and bursts with vintage charm. Not only is this the vessel of choice for serving Moscow Mules, but this mug can also add a truly unique twist to any cocktail presentation and is ideal for enjoying cool, refreshing drinks all year round. Other mugs are simply copper plated interior. Our premium polished hammered mug is copper Stainless Steel throughout. Easy Care Instructions: Hand wash with warm water and liquid dish soap. Towel dry with a soft cloth and you're done! To keep these mugs beautiful for years to come, we recommend not soaking them in water or placing them in the dishwasher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pL38EfMBL._AC_SL1494_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dinazah","source_asin":"B01F1RWAN6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1069624","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01F1RWAN6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01F1RWAN6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
