window.products.push({"id":1069965,"name":"Tea Kettle for Stovetop, 4-Liter(4.3 QT), Stainless Steel Tea Pot with 3-ply Capsule Base, Large Teakettles Tea Pots Quick Heating by Ecpurchase (4-Li","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Wt-xS33uL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Stainless Steel Whistling Tea Kettle, Tea Pots for Stovetop, 4L/4.3Qt, 3-Ply Capsule Base Tea Kettles Quick Heating - Tea Pots by ECPURCHASE EC BUY Whistling Tea Kettle has a Generous Capacity for your whole family! Made from Extra Thick Surgical Grade Stainless Steel, this tea pot is made to last you years! Quickly prepare and serve seasonal drinks, delicious soups, coffee or hot cereals in style using this well-crafted stainless steel kettle.  The whistle kettle works with gas, electric and most induction stove tops. It is good choice for your daily work picnic and camping. A great gift for friends.  Hand-wash recommended, dishwasher safe. Kind Reminder: Please DO NOT burn the empty tea kettle on stove. Specification: Weight: 667g (24 oz)  Color: Sliver Tone  Dimension(D*K): 8.7” x 5.7”  Capacity: 4 Liter (4.3 Quart)  Package Included: 1 x Stainless Steel Whistling Tea Kettle Maintain tips for stainless steel tea kettle: 1.Use white vinegar: White vinegar dilute with 10 times water, boiled the water, stay an hour for cool. Then wash it by clean water.  4.Use soda water: 500 grams baking soda water with a concentration of 1 % in the kettle, gently shake rinse, scale can be removed.  5.Use lemon: Boil the lemon slices in the kettle, pour out after half an hour, then wash it. Kind Reminder: The kettle whistle will not work when the lid is not covered tightly, please make sure cover the lid tightly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Wt-xS33uL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ECPURCHASE","source_asin":"B07C193KM1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1069965","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C193KM1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C193KM1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
